299
00:06:26,660 --> 00:06:27,986
And you don't need to succeed

300
00:06:27,986 --> 00:06:28,870
on your first attempt.

301
00:06:28,870 --> 00:06:30,115
You only need to be willing

302
00:06:30,115 --> 00:06:30,530
to learn,

303
00:06:30,530 --> 00:06:31,130
improve,

304
00:06:31,130 --> 00:06:32,080
and try again.

305
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,540
Take one small step today.

306
00:06:33,540 --> 00:06:34,710
Learn one new skill.

307
00:06:34,710 --> 00:06:36,230
Solve one difficult problem.

308
00:06:36,230 --> 00:06:37,320
Correct one mistake.

309
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:38,030
And tomorrow,

310
00:06:38,030 --> 00:06:39,010
take another step.

311
00:06:39,010 --> 00:06:40,682
Because the distance between where you

312
00:06:40,682 --> 00:06:42,354
are and where you want to

313
00:06:42,354 --> 00:06:44,026
be is often crossed through small

314
00:06:44,026 --> 00:06:45,420
actions repeated consistently over time.

315
00:06:45,420 --> 00:06:47,006
Never underestimate the power of a

316
00:06:47,006 --> 00:06:48,592
person who refuses to give up

317
00:06:48,592 --> 00:06:49,120
on learning.

318
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,700
Your current situation is a chapter

319
00:06:50,700 --> 00:06:51,490
of your life.

320
00:06:51,490 --> 00:06:53,030
It is not the entire story.

321
00:06:53,030 --> 00:06:53,940
And remember this:

322
00:06:53,940 --> 00:06:55,276
You may not be able to

323
00:06:55,276 --> 00:06:56,390
choose where your journey begins,

324
00:06:56,390 --> 00:06:57,727
but you can influence where it

325
00:06:57,727 --> 00:06:59,064
goes through the choices you make

326
00:06:59,064 --> 00:06:59,510
every day.

327
00:06:59,510 --> 00:07:00,580
So keep learning.

328
00:07:00,580 --> 00:07:01,370
Keep building.

329
00:07:01,370 --> 00:07:03,033
Keep believing in your ability to

330
00:07:03,033 --> 00:07:03,310
improve.

331
00:07:03,310 --> 00:07:03,910
One day,

332
00:07:03,910 --> 00:07:05,186
you may look back at the

333
00:07:05,186 --> 00:07:06,462
struggles you are facing today and

334
00:07:06,462 --> 00:07:07,738
realize that they were not the

335
00:07:07,738 --> 00:07:08,590
end of your story.

336
00:07:08,590 --> 00:07:10,330
They were the beginning of your

337
00:07:10,330 --> 00:07:10,620
transformation.

338
00:07:10,620 --> 00:07:11,630
This is your journey.

339
00:07:11,630 --> 00:07:12,890
This is your opportunity.

340
00:07:12,890 --> 00:07:14,390
And your story is still being

341
00:07:14,390 --> 00:07:14,640
written.
